   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 🎮 Universal 3D Asset Pipeline — Geekatplay GameAssetMake\n### (c) Geekatplay Studio / Vladimir Chopine — geekatplay.com\n\nOne prompt → a full pack of engine-ready 3D assets. **🎮 Planner** turns the concept into\nan asset manifest (Ollama designs the list when running, prompt-derived fallback otherwise);\n**🔁 Batch Concept Generator** renders ONE image per asset (each with its own seed, verified\nsingle-object-on-white with auto-retry); the **🖼️ Gallery PAUSES the run** so you tick what\nbecomes 3D and what gets rigged; **🧊 3D Generator** meshes the approved set; **📐 Placement\nManager → ⚡ Unreal Bridge** delivers at true scale.\n\n## Key properties\n- **Planner** — `target_asset_count` (how many assets), `environment_pieces` (modular\n  walls/floors/stairs kit, 0 = props+characters only), `art_style` (30+ styles),\n  `rigging` + `character_pose` (auto-riggers need a symmetrical A/T-pose; the 3/4 hero\n  pose fuses limbs and rigs badly — Auto handles this).\n- **Concept seed ships FIXED on purpose** — with randomize, pressing *Approve & Continue*\n  would regenerate different images and pause again. Use the gallery's **Regenerate\n  Images** button when you want new concepts; it rolls the seeds for you.\n- **Guardrail** (`verify_single_object`, on) — heuristic blob check + optional Ollama\n  vision cross-check (`gemma3:12b`); failures retry with a stricter prompt.\n- **Gallery `approval_mode`** — *PAUSE for my approval* (default) stops before any API\n  credit is spent; or auto-approve all / by group.\n- **3D Generator** — one global `engine` choice (Tripo / Meshy / HiTem3D). Keys typed\n  once with `remember_keys` ON go to the **OS credential vault**, never into this JSON.\n  **`dry_run_mock` is ON** — flip to *Live Cloud APIs* to actually generate.\n- **Bridge master toggle** — *Import + Set Up In Scene* places everything; *Import As\n  Assets Only* just fills `/Game/Assets/AI_Generated/`. **☀️ Sun** node configures the DirectionalLight so\n  imports never render black.\n\n## Models required (concepts)\nZ-Image Turbo: `UNETLoader → z_image_turbo_bf16.safetensors`, `CLIPLoader (lumina2) →\nqwen_3_4b.safetensors`, `VAELoader → ae.safetensors` — 8 steps @ cfg 1.0, 16-ch latents.\nBridge must be running (Unreal :30010); the 🔌 check node shows ONLINE/OFFLINE.\n"
   ],
   "title": "READ ME — Geekatplay GameAssetMake",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  },
